        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Theimei duiriang paeng heithang teini na",
            "Akhang taekdat mak puikai nai e,",
            "Nthanmei nun duipui kaanpat puinung",
            "Heiram gaikhou tei lusuan bamni.",
            "",
            "He neihlapui kai, gaichuipui ram khou",
            "Kaniu mikdui keidat makpui ram khou",
            "Kainungmei guai le kanloumei puta",
            "Taekmakna thuan kariu puni the.",
            "",
            "2. Akhang kapmei le bumaeng rianramei",
            "Kalvary khou keitheilou khourui",
            "Houmumei nunbaan khou theilou khourui",
            "Akhang tingsaeng kai gaimei naithe.",
            "",
            "3. Ai satang thuimak ai neila nimei",
            "Kaanpat loumei tingkao kai ramgai,",
            "Ntam makpui ram gaichuipui ramkhou",
            "Heikhou tei ai guangtang puni the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
